    "location": "Root visually read the complete brochure map and eleven drive minutes on the enlarged original factsheet. The current website marker and radius navigation explicitly name Vista3. Its coordinates remain excluded pending developer clarification. The whole correct Marlin brochure diagram and project-name directions preserve the verified vicinity. Exact home entrances and live routing remain unverified.",
    "provenance": "Fresh8November normal GET receipts retain URLs, dates, bytes and SHA256 for the current original brochure,42page plans and2page factsheet. Exact native-source, whole-page bounds, delivered lossless pixels and browser checks remain required before verified status. Protected owner, IDs, aliases and researched text remain intact."
